** Integrated (Gauss-point-to-segment) contact of a serendipity (hexa20) block against a DISCRETE
** RIGID BODY. The block (1x1 footprint, 2x2x1 hexa20, nu = 0) is pressed onto a fixed rigid box
** (an STL, larger than the footprint) whose top face is at z = 1. The exact solution is homogeneous
** uniaxial stress with a perfectly FLAT interface.
**
** The node-based nodeToDiscreteRigidBodyPenalty cannot represent this state: a quad8 face's
** consistent nodal loads under a uniform pressure are NEGATIVE at the corners (-pA/12, +pA/3 at the
** midsides), which a unilateral per-node spring cannot exert, so the corners lift off. Here the
** pressure is integrated at quadrature points and distributed with the PARENT FACE's quadratic
** shape functions, so the corner nodes carry the tensile load the face demands.
**
** Checked quantities: cornerForce (the minimum slave nodal normal force, negative = pulled) equals
** -4 p A / 12 for an interior corner shared by four faces of area A = 0.25; the interface is flat
** (Uzspread); every quadrature point is closed with the same gap -p/penalty (gapMax); the pressure
** is uniform (pNspread); and the total contact force (contactForce, negative in compression)
** balances the reaction at the loaded face (RFblock).
*material, name=LinearElastic, id=linearelastic, provider=edelweiss
1.8e4, 0.0

*job, name=patchjob, domain=3d
*solver, solver=NIST, name=theSolver

*modelGenerator, generator=boxGen, name=block
nX      =2
nY      =2
nZ      =1
x0      =0
y0      =0
z0      =1.02
lX      =1
lY      =1
lZ      =1
elProvider =edelweiss
elType  =C3D20

*modelGenerator, generator=surfaceElementGenerator, name=gen1
surface = block_back
name    = slaveSurf
triangulation = midside

*modelGenerator, generator=discreteRigidBodyGenerator, name=support, executeAfterManualGeneration=True
filename=support_box.stl
rpCoordinate='0.5, 0.5, 0.5'

*section, name=section1, material=linearelastic, type=solid
block_all

*constraint, name=contact, type=surfaceToDiscreteRigidBodyPenalty
slaveSurface=slaveSurf_facets, rigidBody=support, penalty=3e7, type=linear,
searchDistance=1.0, nQuadraturePoints=3

*fieldOutput
>>perNode, elSet=block_all, field=displacement, result=U, name=displacement
>>perNode, name=RFblock, nSet=block_front, field=displacement, result=P, f(x)='sum(x[:,2])', saveHistory=True
>>fromExpression, name=contactForce, nSet=support_rp, expression='np.array([model.constraints["contact"].totalNormalForce])', f(x)='x[0]', saveHistory=True
>>perNode, name=Uzspread, nSet=slaveSurf_nodes, field=displacement, result=U, f(x)='np.max(x[:,2])-np.min(x[:,2])', saveHistory=True
>>fromExpression, name=gapMax, elSet=slaveSurf_facets, expression='model.constraints["contact"].getGaps()', f(x)='np.max(x)', saveHistory=True
>>fromExpression, name=cornerForce, nSet=slaveSurf_nodes, expression='model.constraints["contact"].getSlaveNodalNormalForces()', f(x)='np.min(x)', saveHistory=True
>>fromExpression, name=pNmean, elSet=slaveSurf_facets, expression='model.constraints["contact"].getNormalPressures()', f(x)='np.mean(x[x>0]) if np.any(x>0) else np.float64(0.0)', saveHistory=True
>>fromExpression, name=pNspread, elSet=slaveSurf_facets, expression='model.constraints["contact"].getNormalPressures()', f(x)='(np.max(x[x>0])-np.min(x[x>0]))/np.mean(x[x>0]) if np.any(x>0) else np.float64(0.0)', saveHistory=True

*output, type=monitor, name=monitor
fieldOutput=RFblock
fieldOutput=contactForce
fieldOutput=Uzspread
fieldOutput=gapMax
fieldOutput=cornerForce
fieldOutput=pNmean
fieldOutput=pNspread

*step, solver=theSolver
maxInc=0.25, minInc=1e-6, maxNumInc=100, maxIter=25, stepLength=1
>>options, name=theSolver, extrapolation=off
>>dirichlet, name=fixSupportDisplacement, nSet=support_rp, field=displacement, 1=0.0, 2=0.0, 3=0.0
>>dirichlet, name=fixSupportRotation, nSet=support_rp, field=rotation, 1=0.0, 2=0.0, 3=0.0
>>dirichlet, name=pushBlock, nSet=block_front, field=displacement, 1=0.0, 2=0.0, 3=-0.06
